{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16553","headline":"游仙 · 刘复","name":"游仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"税驾倚扶桑，逍遥望九州。\n二老佐轩辕，移戈戮蚩尤。\n功成弃之去，乘龙上天游。\n天上见玉皇，寿与天地休。\n俯视崑仑宫，五城十二楼。\n王母何窈眇，玉质清且柔。\n扬袂折琼枝，寄我天东头。\n相思千万岁，大运浩悠悠。\n安用知吾道，日月不能周。\n寄音青鸟翼，谢尔碧海流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}